      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lentöy ECHOTYON Kimuktoghin, “Kïyotyini asisoni kompö pögh pipö ara pöytoghin Daudi nko pipö Yerusalem nyo mwötöy ngokï nko sïmnyontengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongongoghtenan asisoni kaynötut pö körkeyïntin cho soghöy pich kewutyeghö. Opuktenan pich cho ighöy kegh lö kïchï werkoy nko cho soghöy körkeyïntin kïpegha kor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany kunomchï chi kegh lö ochï werkoyon, kïmïchini kïmwochï kwanta nko kame, chini kiyï nyinte lö, ‘Mïchini ketïghinyi ompöwölo kemwaghanyi putintön ompö kayna ECHOTYON.’ Atolapay kïpara chok chichay yiyichi atotösöy tagh kïngoröy ngal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nömöy arasï osiswechoni werkoyon ompö sïwïyaghtinechi otini mwochini pich. Melokönye sampu werkoyon atökïlïs pich lö ochï werkoyon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo mwoghöy anka tïkwïl lö, ‘Melö ochan werkoyon, ochan ngorinto par akyongorsyan kïngata otini kyochan mïnïng.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany ketep lö, ‘Ayo, pö ne moyochï mi pataghungu?’ Kïlö, ‘Kyonyorchan kato kongotichan.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kikïmwa kepar Mösöwonto ECHOTYON",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
